25166887 15045 15243
E
runes gate~
"Yog-Sothoth guards the gate to the prison of the Elder Gods.  The only way to
obtain the key to the gate is to defeat him, and that won't be easy.  If you
can defeat him, you might have a chance at the creatures beyond this gate, but
once you enter, there is no turning back, and safety is not to be taken for
granted.  Any less than a group of level 50 adventurer's should head back
now."
~
